reason = "AssumeEntry is #[serde(deny_unknown_fields)] (line 71) and its fields are {text, status, text_hash, body_hash, file, site, covered_region, linked, parent} (lines 72-87) — no verify. The doc comment (lines 65-69) records the design: assume has no verify because assumptions are not verification targets per A5. So a refactor trying to verify assumes would have to first change the schema, which is precisely the design choice the parent intent says is rejected."
